{"id":"torrey:shields","source":"torrey","name":"Shields","slug":"shields","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"A part of defensive armour — Ps 115:9; 140:7.","refs":[["Ps",115,9,115,9],["Ps",140,7,140,7]]},{"text":"Gold. — 2Sa 8:7; 1Ki 10:17.","refs":[["2Sam",8,7,8,7],["1Kgs",10,17,10,17]]},{"text":"Brass. — 1Ki 14:27.","refs":[["1Kgs",14,27,14,27]]},{"text":"Said to belong to God — Ps 47:9.","refs":[["Ps",47,9,47,9]]},{"text":"The buckler or target. — 2Ch 9:15; 1Ch 5:18; Eze 26:8.","refs":[["2Chr",9,15,9,15],["1Chr",5,18,5,18],["Ezek",26,8,26,8]]},{"text":"The small shield. — 2Ch 9:16.","refs":[["2Chr",9,16,9,16]]},{"text":"Often borne by an armour bearer. — 1Sa 17:7.","refs":[["1Sam",17,7,17,7]]},{"text":"Gathered together. — Jer 51:11.","refs":[["Jer",51,11,51,11]]},{"text":"Uncovered. — Isa 22:6.","refs":[["Isa",22,6,22,6]]},{"text":"Repaired. — Jer 46:3.","refs":[["Jer",46,3,46,3]]},{"text":"Anointed. — 2Sa 1:21; Isa 21:5.","refs":[["2Sam",1,21,1,21],["Isa",21,5,21,5]]},{"text":"Often made red. — Na 2:3.","refs":[["Nah",2,3,2,3]]},{"text":"Provided by the kings of Israel in great abundance — 2Ch 11:12; 26:14; 32:5.","refs":[["2Chr",11,12,11,12],["2Chr",26,14,26,14],["2Chr",32,5,32,5]]},{"text":"A disgrace to lose, or throw away — 2Sa 1:21.","refs":[["2Sam",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"Of the vanquished, often burned — Eze 39:9.","refs":[["Ezek",39,9,39,9]]},{"text":"In times of peace were hung up in towers or armouries — Eze 27:10; Song 4:4.","refs":[["Ezek",27,10,27,10],["Song",4,4,4,4]]},{"text":"Were scarce in Israel in the days of Deborah and Barak — Jdj 5:8.","refs":[["Judg",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"Many of the Israelites used, with expertness — 1Ch 12:8,24,34; 2Ch 14:8; 25:5.","refs":[["1Chr",12,8,12,8],["1Chr",12,24,12,24],["1Chr",12,34,12,34],["2Chr",14,8,14,8],["2Chr",25,5,25,5]]},{"text":"Protection of God. — Ge 15:1; Ps 33:20.","refs":[["Gen",15,1,15,1],["Ps",33,20,33,20]]},{"text":"Favour of God. — Ps 5:12.","refs":[["Ps",5,12,5,12]]},{"text":"Truth of God. — Ps 91:4.","refs":[["Ps",91,4,91,4]]},{"text":"Salvation of God. — 2Sa 22:36; Ps 18:35.","refs":[["2Sam",22,36,22,36],["Ps",18,35,18,35]]},{"text":"Faith. — Eph 6:16.","refs":[["Eph",6,16,6,16]]}],"refCount":37}
